{"id":899,"slug":"899-viet-ham-retry-voi-exponential-backoff","category":"JavaScript","subcategory":"Coding Challenge","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Viết hàm retry với exponential backoff?","question_en":"Write a retry function with exponential backoff.","answer_vi":"Exponential backoff retry một async call failing với delay tăng dần (1s, 2s, 4s...).\n\n```js\nasync function retry(fn, maxRetries = 3, delay = 1000) {\n  for (let i = 0; i < maxRetries; i++) {\n    try { return await fn(); }\n    catch (err) {\n      if (i === maxRetries - 1) throw err;\n      await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, delay * 2 ** i));\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nDùng cho API calls không ổn định. Delay tăng: 1s, 2s, 4s.","answer_en":"Exponential backoff retries a failing async call with a growing delay (1s, 2s, 4s…).\n\n```js\nasync function retry(fn, maxRetries = 3, delay = 1000) {\n  for (let i = 0; i < maxRetries; i++) {\n    try { return await fn(); }\n    catch (err) {\n      if (i === maxRetries - 1) throw err;\n      await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, delay * 2 ** i));\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nUseful for flaky API calls. The delay grows: 1s, 2s, 4s.","answer_html_vi":"<p>Exponential backoff retry một async call failing với delay tăng dần (1s, 2s, 4s...).</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"async function retry(fn, maxRetries = 3, delay = 1000) {\n  for (let i = 0; i &lt; maxRetries; i++) {\n    try { return await fn(); }\n    catch (err) {\n      if (i === maxRetries - 1) throw err;\n      await new Promise(r =&gt; setTimeout(r, delay * 2 ** i));\n    }\n  }\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">retry</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">fn, maxRetries = <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>, delay = <span class=\"hljs-number\">1000</span></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> i = <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>; i &lt; maxRetries; i++) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span> { <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fn</span>(); }\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span> (err) {\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (i === maxRetries - <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">throw</span> err;\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">r</span> =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">setTimeout</span>(r, delay * <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span> ** i));\n    }\n  }\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Dùng cho API calls không ổn định.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Delay tăng: 1s, 2s, 4s.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>Exponential backoff retries a failing async call with a growing delay (1s, 2s, 4s…).</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"async function retry(fn, maxRetries = 3, delay = 1000) {\n  for (let i = 0; i &lt; maxRetries; i++) {\n    try { return await fn(); }\n    catch (err) {\n      if (i === maxRetries - 1) throw err;\n      await new Promise(r =&gt; setTimeout(r, delay * 2 ** i));\n    }\n  }\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">retry</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">fn, maxRetries = <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>, delay = <span class=\"hljs-number\">1000</span></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> i = <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>; i &lt; maxRetries; i++) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span> { <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fn</span>(); }\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span> (err) {\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (i === maxRetries - <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">throw</span> err;\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">r</span> =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">setTimeout</span>(r, delay * <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span> ** i));\n    }\n  }\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Useful for flaky API calls.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">The delay grows: 1s, 2s, 4s.</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/201-su-khac-biet-giua-var-let-va-const-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa var, let và const là gì?"},{"url":"/q/202-javascript-co-nhung-kieu-du-lieu-nguyen-thuy-primitive-types-nao","title":"JavaScript có những kiểu dữ liệu nguyên thuỷ (primitive types) nào?"},{"url":"/q/205-symbol-trong-javascript-la-gi-va-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Symbol trong JavaScript là gì và dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/207-toan-tu-va-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"Toán tử == và === khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/208-type-coercion-ep-kieu-tu-dong-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Type coercion (ép kiểu tự động) trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/209-truthy-va-falsy-values-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Truthy và falsy values trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/210-nan-la-gi-tai-sao-nan-nan","title":"NaN là gì? Tại sao NaN !== NaN?"},{"url":"/q/211-hoisting-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Hoisting trong JavaScript là gì?"}]}